{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年30歲、2020年入圍十強港姐的陳若思（Amber），最近憑藉戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》人氣急升！在最新一集中，她大方以素顏出鏡，依然非常亮眼。不過人紅是非多，近日有網民翻出她初入行時拍攝「無對白」短片的過去，甚至重提她與富三代鍾培生的昔日緋聞。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳若思因《女神配對計劃2》人氣急升。（ig@amberchann46）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199104256364384256374265.jpeg/RoVDmbZ9MIWpncPE9x40BRE3Tl76QqkbZK-8MWSvvDE\"/><figcaption>陳若思因《女神配對計劃2》人氣急升。（ig@amberchann46）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳若思因《女神配對計劃2》人氣急升。（ig@amberchann46）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199104253445017600782315.jpeg/m3YobuZW1v7P6F4aVmfNrKTdBzv2PvXm2k7nZdpO52U\"/><figcaption>陳若思因《女神配對計劃2》人氣急升。（ig@amberchann46）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"身材勁好。（ig@amberchann46）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199104176747974656814265.jpeg/5lmxH7UogtFgfyJ7kPh5jCL8rOgbRqjUSxyQkUsckJE\"/><figcaption>身材勁好。（ig@amberchann46）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"當時年近30歲嘅陳若思在《正義女神》演學生妹，零違和感。（ig@amberchann46）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199108226193297408160958.jpeg/jI3aWaRHxtvUjeMGq9Y-qKDrJtRXMiteS-rqJ0vq6ic\"/><figcaption>當時年近30歲嘅陳若思在《正義女神》演學生妹，零違和感。（ig@amberchann46）</figcaption></figure><p>卸下濃妝 素顏展現清純氣質</p><p>在《女神配對計劃2》最新的水族館露營環節中，陳若思大方卸妝，穿上黑白卡通狗圖案睡衣並戴上黑框眼鏡，愜意地躺在帳篷內。她對著鏡頭展露燦爛微笑兼比出V字手勢，褪去平日的精緻濃妝後，瞬間化身為清純的鄰家女孩，獲大批網民激讚其素顏狀態極佳，充滿反差魅力。</p><figure><img alt=\"激罕素顏出場。（TVB）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199104434777362432206519.jpeg/VOo8LPDiFDDtbQS-zFiYeIKjLi3bPFm-3M3dp9zN3ac\"/><figcaption>激罕素顏出場。（TVB）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"激罕素顏出場。（TVB）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199104561340747776489301.jpeg/FcmkXCOo_WlZ9TKShERTwZm_OLYHAGKDewUon3sFKJ8\"/><figcaption>激罕素顏出場。（TVB）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（TVB）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199104556684808192059281.jpeg/l836XPW3ysdyzX0-2ok89gW_X1Xyyd2YfhJ_qH4Sf6g\"/><figcaption>（TVB）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（TVB）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199104559113441280620983.jpeg/yC2sFM9UxG0FyxFOqX2xiZ5i_2djdfYuhf3m3oX95t4\"/><figcaption>（TVB）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（TVB）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199105505679642624561840.jpeg/TGpCDMu2wlUUKXGiFuYLM_lw1iacuRbZbp6rRW6eq0U\"/><figcaption>（TVB）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（TVB）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199105508309602304895673.jpeg/I0LJmsW9XHC3kmjfbZpWzpxgq3QAq-FVGsm9lBrJvZQ\"/><figcaption>（TVB）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（TVB）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199105510687903744963802.jpeg/KBvOcX-q54ZZEHuqrSENu6rp7cBR9mZSBPpWxQT6VsU\"/><figcaption>（TVB）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（TVB）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199105512940376064057263.jpeg/XAwgNKYCPUO3hzdQDaoYU1XCDVe1UJYpwchV-8HIVfs\"/><figcaption>（TVB）</figcaption></figure><p>11年前舊作曝光　由無名角色捱出頭</p><p>隨著人氣攀升，陳若思的青澀過去亦被網民翻出。原來早在約10至11年前、年僅19歲時，她已涉足網絡演藝圈，當時以原名「陳紫瑩」參與YouTube網片拍攝，參演過不少零對白小角色，包括在劇集《PA血淚史》中飾演偽女團成員跳二創歌曲《Sugar Daddy》，又曾於拳擊網片擔任舉牌小姐大騷纖腰。從昔日的臨時演員蛻變成今日的綜藝女神，不少網民感嘆她確實是憑著努力一步一腳印捱出知名度。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳若思曾於拳擊網片擔任舉牌小姐大騷纖腰。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199105983872241664201569.png/OGcdVtsS0m848qUdX9I-9VEovfgE_Du2FDUPXRQ1D10\"/><figcaption>陳若思曾於拳擊網片擔任舉牌小姐大騷纖腰。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"未成名前拍過唔少YouTube短片。（YouTube擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199106121680293888357819.png/PUGLGKQt3At4IuDi-wbHvvn9LwLUpU9KtHaDILR2gyA\"/><figcaption>未成名前拍過唔少YouTube短片。（YouTube擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"舊作被翻。（YouTube擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199106187723804672314726.png/l73GJTBDN49rweOQNSOoWAAZdP5OU6hykz74DpM--A4\"/><figcaption>舊作被翻。（YouTube擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樣子青澀。（YouTube擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199106190240518144628037.png/roKvqq3kiwvPLyC2cA6VQYhn6bSS6l25WOcYZljnGGY\"/><figcaption>樣子青澀。（YouTube擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樣子青澀。（YouTube擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199106192631402496834172.png/oC-nOEfpuhhugUfhPBq5uxFSyZACB0WnmQN8HJkDfBw\"/><figcaption>樣子青澀。（YouTube擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"冇對白。（YouTube擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199106195265556480154072.png/-qCn3svK0E-H4CFDNbvQ9p2LAhNJ-xjTYsVCjmLFQo4\"/><figcaption>冇對白。（YouTube擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"冇對白。（YouTube擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199106197488668672216589.png/uDYUnHGRiVwSHwhmHvM7vajC1p3G7vH1LAObISwDmyE\"/><figcaption>冇對白。（YouTube擷圖）</figcaption></figure><p>嚴正否認包養傳聞　澄清僅屬上下屬</p><p>事實上，陳若思自參選港姐以來便話題不斷。當年面試時，她因佩戴名貴靚錶現身而成為全場焦點，貴氣行頭更令同場的港姐師姐馮盈盈都留意到。事實上，她早於2015年已加入富三代兼香港電競公司老闆鍾培生旗下的香港電競（HKEsports）擔任電競模特兒與隊員，因而一度傳出戀情乃至「包養」傳聞。</p><p>面對諸多揣測，陳若思早年已親自出面嚴正否認，公開澄清雙方「從未拍拖」。她強調兩人僅屬老闆與下屬的工作關係，因為自己熱衷打遊戲才獲邀加入電競隊，一直只視對方為哥哥看待，離職後已多年未見。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳若思被指愛收兵，身上有唔少名牌。（ig@amberchann46）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199106484852494336269351.jpeg/kpVRdUfGb4VVAckVMw9BnVPs7ccjFDfbpzAREacwERE\"/><figcaption>陳若思被指愛收兵，身上有唔少名牌。（ig@amberchann46）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳若思被指愛收兵，身上有唔少名牌。（ig@amberchann46）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199109857488146432013857.jpeg/C95g017g0CIuOARizwAbXP422FkcImaZA3j5qwN4-as\"/><figcaption>陳若思被指愛收兵，身上有唔少名牌。（ig@amberchann46）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生係出名富三代。（ig@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199106289079554048690814.jpeg/boS0tkNNARAl4quD2xO7fBvFAgm1PysQp71OYKe9TmA\"/><figcaption>鍾培生係出名富三代。（ig@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳若思曾與鍾培生傳緋聞。（ig@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199106286755778560402587.jpeg/1u6IFWeydNZd8AUeiEzm49hs_hOibVro2ohDndqIQ50\"/><figcaption>陳若思曾與鍾培生傳緋聞。（ig@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳若思曾解釋只係老闆同下屬關係。（ig@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199106284327145472172486.jpeg/b6Q-cIZCbuDVBAN7rH85m4q59PvxXPv5ElzIQxJcyEM\"/><figcaption>陳若思曾解釋只係老闆同下屬關係。（ig@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生婚後，嘴邊都係掛住老婆。而佢亦好順，每年新年都會跪地斟茶俾父母。（ig@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199106281797849088067392.jpeg/e46GPX638eHxSRqCPMpMXbxnlIngZT7mjEzYbYxM2G0\"/><figcaption>鍾培生婚後，嘴邊都係掛住老婆。而佢亦好順，每年新年都會跪地斟茶俾父母。（ig@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:19:09.989368+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1270,"images":25,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:45:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T14:32:41.261145+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:12:29.276582+00:00","content_hash":"f78641546a847c6660423a98c7f64143f08f9265e97a9748d2c7db929829f5aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}